---
// Add Pagefind search to a static documentation site: checked against the
// search, i18n, versioning, navigation, frontmatter, and deployment docs, and
// against the source on main: search/adapters/pagefind.ts, search/build.ts,
// search/pagefind-ranking.ts, search/adapters/version-scope.ts,
// deploy/artifacts.ts (the build log lines), core/manifest.ts (what's
// indexable), components/layout/RootLayout.astro (data-pagefind-body and
